    "LastContacted": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "Exactly one of ``within_days``, ``older_than_days``, ``never``.\n\n``older_than_days`` needs a value: never-contacted people do not count as\ncontacted long ago. Combine with ``never`` under ``or`` for both.",
